CPUTEST ss20 psr=40400fc0 nwindows=8 fpu=1
PASS alu: every integer ALU instruction, table of vectors
PASS alu: sethi / set / %hi %lo
PASS alu: wr/rd %y, xor semantics of wr
PASS ldst: byte/half/word loads, sign extension, big-endian
PASS ldst: byte/half stores merge into the word
PASS ldst: ldd/std register pairs
PASS ldst: ldstub and swap
PASS ldst: lda/sta with ASI 0xb (supervisor data) and bypass
PASS ldst: misaligned accesses trap (tt 0x07)
PASS branch: 16 Bicc conditions x 16 icc values
PASS branch: 16 Ticc conditions x 16 icc values
PASS branch: annul bit and delay slots
PASS branch: call/jmpl link register, computed jumps
PASS trap: ta n -> tt 0x80+n, trap PC/nPC, register+imm number
PASS trap: unimp and invalid opcodes -> illegal_instruction
PASS trap: rett with traps enabled -> illegal_instruction
